     <target value="30.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&amp;gt;The commission reviewed significantly more processes than foreseen by the target. Of the 55 processes reviewed, 52 have all the documents published as defined per due process. The committee&amp;nbsp;also issued a report with lessons learned and recommendations for future decrees establishing emergency procurement processes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&amp;gt;</narrative>
